  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moments later, Wang Er drops a mountain of binders and hard drives onto Bu Xiaogu's desk so she can prepare for next week's meeting with Chun Yuqiao. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，准备好和淳于乔开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "下个星期的这个时候，我们要从现在就开始准备。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这些资料，还有这四百个小时的录像资料。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你要全部研究清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有问题！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "用不着了，下周你就死了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下周我就死了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "待会儿你就知道了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，准备好和淳于乔开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, get ready to have a meeting with Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "下个星期的这个时候，我们要从现在就开始准备。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This time next week — we need to start preparing right from now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这些资料，还有这四百个小时的录像资料。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These files, plus these four hundred hours of video recordings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你要全部研究清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You need to study all of it thoroughly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有问题！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No problem at all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "用不着了，下周你就死了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will not need that drink anymore — next week you are dead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下周我就死了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next week I am dead?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "待会儿你就知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In a little while you will find out.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，准备好和淳于乔开会。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "下个星期的这个时候，我们要从现在就开始准备。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这些资料，还有这四百个小时的录像资料。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你要全部研究清楚。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有问题！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "用不着了，下周你就死了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下周我就死了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "待会儿你就知道了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xiaogu dives straight into four hundred hours of footage so she will be ready for next week's meeting. You learned \"xianzai\", two ways to say \"next week\", and \"meiyou wenti\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
